
# exit: 0
exec homebot -h
# deliberate: guided setup: the setup summary describes the guided run; the TypeScript's setup only installed the guard and helper
# deliberate: persona command adds its help overview row
cmpwork stdout help-overview-short.stdout
cmpwork stderr help-overview-short.stderr
-- help-overview-short.stdout --
homebot: Attention-Deficit Home Discipline

  homebot [--all]                   what needs you (the inbox)
  homebot next                      do the first thing in the inbox

Moving in
  homebot unpack [profile]          install and link everything a profile lists
  homebot pack <path>...            move something from $HOME into the repo, link it back
  homebot link                      make every link, show what's in the way
  homebot unlink                    remove every link homebot made (files stay in the repo)
  homebot cleanup                   go through what link --backup moved aside

Secrets
  homebot keys init                 create the key pair (asks for a passphrase)
  homebot unlock                    decrypt private/ (asks for the passphrase)
  homebot lock                      encrypt changed secrets

Keeping order
  homebot triage                    decide about new things: track, ignore or snooze
  homebot inventory                 what's managed and what isn't
  homebot remote [url]              set up where the repo is backed up
  homebot save                      commit, pull and push
  homebot export [name...]          snapshot installed packages into manifests/
  homebot tidy                      run the background chores now
  homebot setup                     set up this machine, from nothing to an empty inbox
  homebot actions                   list the actions profiles can use
  homebot action <name> [args...]   run one action by hand
  homebot shell zsh                 print the shell integration
  homebot name [word]               show, change or turn off your homebot's command name
  homebot persona [command]         list and manage personas

Details, options and examples for any command: homebot <command> --help
-- help-overview-short.stderr --
